    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Puzzle-Platformer (Bird Game), you play as a cute bird named Oolahla in what starts seemingly like a normal bird day. Something is different about today, though... <br> <br>Talk to crazy characters in this wacky island world to learn crazy new moves and help Oolahla maneuver her way through the day. <br><br>Do you know what it takes to be a bird? Will you survive the bird day? <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wacky world like none before it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about your body and what kind of moves you can do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out what it's like to be a bird.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to funny characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat bird food and make new bird food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to music.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Puzzle-Platformer (Bird Game), you play as a cute bird named Oolahla in what starts seemingly like a normal bird day. Something is different about today, though... <br> <br>Talk to crazy characters in this wacky island world to learn crazy new moves and help Oolahla maneuver her way through the day. <br><br>Do you know what it takes to be a bird? Will you survive the bird day? <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wacky world like none before it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about your body and what kind of moves you can do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out what it's like to be a bird.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to funny characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat bird food and make new bird food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to music.</p></li></ul>",
